<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - COREStaff a strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - COREStaff a strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of COREStaff Inc with a strong buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 23-1/4 in morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
